<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Gillette raised, intermediate-term.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Gillette raised, intermediate-term.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said it raised Gillette Co on Tuesday on an intermediate-term basis to buy from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Stock remains a long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- Shares closed Tuesday at $83 on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
